..\..\..\..\.env	path	REFUSE	-	Windows-separator traversal out of the study root
subdir/../../outside.txt	path	REFUSE	-	traversal that only escapes after normalisation
/etc/passwd	path	REFUSE	-	an absolute POSIX path
